{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_java_pages_phase_11_testing_04_mockito_09c_property_and_field_injection", "label": "09c-property-and-field-injection.md", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "page", "source_file": "docs/java/pages/phase-11-testing/04-mockito/09c-property-and-field-injection.md", "source_location": "L1", "frontmatter": {"title": "The second injection strategy instantiates the object with a no-arg constructor, walks its class hierarchy, skips every final and static field, sorts what is left by name with supertypes pushed to the back, and then runs a three-filter chain that consults the mock&#x27;s NAME only when more than one candidate survives the type filter \u2014 and unlike constructor injection, it throws when it cannot decide", "sidebar_label": "09c \u00b7 Property and field injection", "sidebar_position": "38"}, "_origin": "ast"}, {"id": "docs_java_pages_phase_11_testing_04_mockito_09c_property_and_field_injection_the_algorithm_in_mockito_s_own_words", "label": "The algorithm, in Mockito's own words", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/java/pages/phase-11-testing/04-mockito/09c-property-and-field-injection.md", "source_location": "L27", "_origin": "ast"}, {"id": "docs_java_pages_phase_11_testing_04_mockito_09c_property_and_field_injection_step_0_instantiation_and_the_one_place_injectmocks_reliably_explodes", "label": "\ud83d\udd34 Step 0 \u2014 instantiation, and the one place `@InjectMocks` reliably explodes", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/java/pages/phase-11-testing/04-mockito/09c-property-and-field-injection.md", "source_location": "L43", "_origin": "ast"}, {"id": "docs_java_pages_phase_11_testing_04_mockito_09c_property_and_field_injection_the_hierarchy_walk_and_once_per_class", "label": "The hierarchy walk, and \"once per class\"", "file_type": "document", "node_kind": "heading", "source_file": "docs/java/pages/phase-11-testing/04-mockito/09c-property-and-field-injection.m